{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"61a5e89d6606b621fa526ccc11faca8dfa9062aa5541bd319bd3d1f057495040","digest":{"component_or_area":"pre-commit configuration","key_entities":[".pre-commit-config.yaml","no-commit-to-branch hook","pre-commit/pre-commit-hooks repository","main branch","master branch","args parameter"],"problem_keywords":["pre-commit hooks","branch protection","commit prevention","fail-fast validation","local enforcement"],"propositions":["Direct commits to main/master are not blocked at git-commit time, only caught later at push/review via server-side gates.","The no-commit-to-branch hook from pre-commit/pre-commit-hooks must be added to .pre-commit-config.yaml with explicit args listing both main and master branches.","Explicit args configuration documents intent inline and is robust to upstream hook default changes, despite the current default already protecting main.","After the hook is registered, git commit while HEAD is on main/master must be rejected with non-zero exit code.","The configuration change must not break existing linting, typecheck, or YAML validation hooks."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785825029738801761,"uuid":"08f98dea-d9f2-4932-bdfe-55ca92798275"}